OL,3,GNEWSAMet was negligent and reckless,
OL,4,Asisters of 'Putney pusher' suspect tell
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe sisters of the man suspected of
OL,8,Fbeing the so-called "Putney pusher"
OL,9,Fhave told the BBC the Metropolitan
OL,10,FPolice was "negligent" and "reckless"
OL,11,Fin its handling of the case.
OL,13,FNicholas Brandram was under suspicion
OL,14,Fof being the jogger who pushed a woman
OL,15,Finto the path of a bus during a run on
OL,16,FPutney Bridge, west London, in May
OL,17,F2017.
OL,19,FHis family said he was innocent and
OL,20,F"took his own life after months of
OL,21,Fimmense pressure" caused by the
OL,22,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
